(
    title: "Cat Trax",
    description: Some("You are the cat; Rover, Lassie and Fido charge out of the doghouse after you while you gobble the catnip dotted along the trax. Snapping up the Power Potion transforms you into a dog-catching truck — slam the dogs home while the siren lasts — with a bag of gold under each fresh maze and a thousand-point bonus for clearing every catnip while the dogs are locked up. Two variations: the blue maze for beginners, the pink maze with a faster purple dog for pros."),
